	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06r0401_cliff_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:PokemonNickname ]は
コバルオン　ビリジオン　テラキオンの▽
３びきが　きざみこんだ　けついから▽
しんぴのつるぎを　おもいだした！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-24T03:22:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-12-19T02:56:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:PokemonNickname ]は
コバルオン　ビリジオン　テラキオンの▽
３匹が　刻みこんだ　決意から▽
しんぴのつるぎを　思い出した！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-24T03:21:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-12-19T02:57:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ケルディオイベント用
・0＝ポケモンニックネーム
・わざを４つ覚えている場合はわざ忘れ処理へ
・４つ未満の場合はフォルムチェンジ処理へ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-12-19T02:58:30" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SYS</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-12-19T02:56:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T06:22:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06r0401_cliff_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]は
すでに　わざを　４つ　おぼえている！▽
わざを　わすれさせますか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-19T10:28:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-12-19T03:47:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]は
すでに　技を　４つ　覚えている！▽
技を　忘れさせますか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-19T10:29:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-12-19T03:48:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>・技スロットに空きがない場合
・はい/いいえ選択肢表示
　はい　→技忘れ画面へ
　いいえ→cliff_06
・0＝ケルディオのニックネーム</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-12-19T03:50:42" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SYS</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00289"
				Time="2011-12-19T03:49:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T06:22:04" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ff8040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t06r0401_cliff_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>それでは　しんぴのつるぎを
おもいだすのを　あきらめますか？</Text>
